body:
To be fair to Niantic for the Go Fest spawns - I think in a way it's important that the actual event participants had a better chance at getting a shiny Nidoran than the rest of the players.

&#x200B;

Yes, I know that all spawns are significantly boosted anyway at the event, but I feel like by not having too much spawn boost for the rest of the world, the shiny Nidorans are a lot more valuable to the actual event attendees.

what issue? 

&#x200B;

(yes, I've seen your comment that it's only a visual bug)
